Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 13:22:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Commercial model 2026: plans, packs, checklists, D1-backed
 training

- plans.py: plan catalogue from D1 with cached entitlement resolution
  (pack expiry, per-seat counts, legacy tier mapping)
- training.py: modules and Swedish translations loaded from D1; bilingual
  certificates with content version
- app.py: TIERS removed; limits and gating from entitlements; Stripe
  Checkout for subscriptions and one-time packs; webhook handling for
  checkout.session.completed and subscription lifecycle; checklist routes
  with per-tenant progress; Article 4 evidence report; locale support
- dashboard: pricing rendered from /api/billing/plans with a pay-once row,
  checklists page and modal, language switch, evidence report button
- landing page: amended timeline, Article 50 feature, new pricing

