 """
 Comply AI — Article 4 AI Literacy Training Module System
 
-Provides structured training content, quizzes, and completion tracking
-to satisfy the mandatory AI literacy requirement under Article 4 of
-the EU AI Act (in force since February 2, 2025).
-
-Training is role-based and tiered:
-  - Basic (Starter): 3 foundational modules
-  - Full (Pro/Enterprise): 10+ modules including role-specific content
+Module content is no longer hard-coded here. It lives in the D1 tables
+`training_modules` and `training_module_translations`, seeded from the
+eu-ai-act-compliance-d1 repository (content/training-modules.json and
+content/translations/*.json). That content reflects the AI Act as amended by
+Regulation (EU) 2026/1744 (the Digital Omnibus on AI).
+
+This module keeps the same public API the routes use:
+  get_modules_for_tier(tier, locale="en")
+  get_module_content(module_id, locale="en")
+  grade_quiz(module_id, answers, locale="en")
+  generate_certificate_html(...)
+
+Call training.configure(d1_query) once at startup.
 """
 
